{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17443","headline":"八音诗 · 权德舆","name":"八音诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金谷盛繁华，凉台列簪组。\n石崇留客醉，绿珠当座舞。\n丝泪可销骨，冶容竟何补。\n竹林谅贤人，满酌无所苦。\n匏居容宴豆，儒室贵环堵。\n土鼓与污尊，颐神则爲愈。\n革道当在早，谦光斯可取。\n木鴈才不才，吾知养生主。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}